WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.063 --> 00:00:04.992
"I'm from Space Patrol!" Lucy said.

2
00:00:04.993 --> 00:00:10.128
"B-but where's Diva?" the kidnapper said.

3
00:00:10.129 --> 00:00:13.611
"On Concert Planet," Lucy said.

4
00:00:13.612 --> 00:00:16.688
"She has a big show tonight.

5
00:00:16.689 --> 00:00:21.327
And you're under arrest!"

6
00:00:21.328 --> 00:00:27.265
"Grr!" The kidnapper threw the flowers at Lucy.

7
00:00:27.266 --> 00:00:30.255
Lucy spun around and kicked.

8
00:00:30.256 --> 00:00:37.014
The flowers flew everywhere.

9
00:00:37.015 --> 00:00:39.188
The kidnapper ran.

10
00:00:39.189 --> 00:00:49.451
PJ zoomed after him.

11
00:00:49.452 --> 00:00:54.986
"Ack!" The kidnapper cried. "Let me go!"

12
00:00:54.987 --> 00:00:57.804
PJ held the kidnapper's arms.

13
00:00:57.805 --> 00:01:28.180
Lucy ran over. "You're going to jail!"

14
00:01:28.181 --> 00:01:32.322
Ringo was backstage at Diva's concert.

15
00:01:32.323 --> 00:01:38.949
His phone rang. "Hello?"

16
00:01:38.950 --> 00:01:41.285
"Tiny!" Lucy said.

17
00:01:41.286 --> 00:01:44.170
"We got the kidnapper!"

18
00:01:44.171 --> 00:01:47.200
"Good job!" Ringo said.

19
00:01:47.201 --> 00:01:50.954
"And Diva is safe on Concert Planet."

20
00:01:50.955 --> 00:01:54.132
"That's great," Lucy said.

21
00:01:54.133 --> 00:01:56.880
But she looked sad.

22
00:01:56.881 --> 00:02:00.333
"What's wrong?" Ringo asked.

23
00:02:00.334 --> 00:02:06.921
Lucy sighed. "You can watch Diva's concert.

24
00:02:06.922 --> 00:02:11.296
But I'll miss it."

25
00:02:11.297 --> 00:02:15.565
Diva spotted the kidnapper on Ringo's phone.

26
00:02:15.566 --> 00:02:19.870
"Why did you try to kidnap me?" she asked.

27
00:02:19.871 --> 00:02:24.752
He frowned. "I'm your biggest fan.

28
00:02:24.753 --> 00:02:30.124
But I couldn't get tickets to your concert."

29
00:02:30.125 --> 00:02:34.222
"Too bad," Donny snapped.

30
00:02:34.223 --> 00:02:38.325
"Everyone wants tickets to Diva's concert!"

31
00:02:38.326 --> 00:02:41.938
"Hmm," Ringo thought.

